                        <h1 class="maunga-banner__heading">Maungawhau</h1>

                        
                            <div class="maunga-banner__pronounciation">
                                
                                    <span class="maunga-banner__pronounciation-text">mow-nga-foe</span>
                                

                                
                                    <div class="maunga-banner__pronounciation-audio">
                                        <audio id="AudioTitle" src="https://maunga.nz/assets/Pronunciation-Audio/Maungawhau_01.mp3" type="audio/mp3"></audio>
                                        <button type="button" onclick="if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; AudioTitle.currentTime = 0; AudioTitle.play();" aria-label="Play audio for Maungawhau" data-cf-modified-b93d69c9d597c3455efb08e8-="">
                                    </div>
                                
                            </div>
                        

                        
                            <h2 class="maunga-banner__subheading">Mount Eden</h2>
                        

                        <p>Maungawhau was an enormous Māori pā - a citadel built for thousands of inhabitants.</p>

                        
